<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>King 180 degree change for instant shots into goal for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.8 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can shoot the ball into the net without having to rotate on ur own and it automatically locks in the opposite of the goalkeeper :D
this was part of the first form script btw have fun !!!
</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 21 1
KeyUp 21 1
KeyDown 44 1
KeyUp 44 1
MoveTo 1806 529
MoveR 282 18
Delay 15 ms
RightDown 1
RightUp 1</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>